WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.976
Welcome to AroNexa for clinics. Here's a quick look at reception and the clinic admin.

00:05.976 --> 00:13.168
The live queue shows every patient, from the app, phone, WhatsApp and walk-ins. Check them in as they arrive.

00:13.168 --> 00:17.907
Collect fees at the desk, and call the next patient when the doctor is ready.

00:17.907 --> 00:21.088
Walk-in adds someone new straight into today's queue.

00:21.088 --> 00:28.408
At risk shows patients who are late or haven't confirmed. Offer their slot to someone else, or mark a no-show.

00:28.408 --> 00:32.827
Appointments lists every booking, so you can reschedule or cancel.

00:32.827 --> 00:40.083
The clinic admin sees visits, waiting times, cancellations and revenue, with patterns worth acting on.

00:40.083 --> 00:48.704
Staff and roles is where you invite your team. Setup, subscription, billing and reports are in the tabs. Now, start exploring.
